@startuml AbsenceSaga

actor Employee
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "AbsenceService (Saga)" as Absence
participant "EmployeeService" as EmployeeSvc
participant Manager
participant HR
participant "AttendanceService" as Attendance
database "RabbitMQ" as MQ

== Request ==
Employee -> Gateway: POST /api/absences
Gateway -> Absence: CreateLeaveRequest
Absence -> EmployeeSvc: GET /api/employees/{id}/status
EmployeeSvc --> Absence: 200 OK (Active)
Absence -> Absence: PlaceHold (DB)
Absence -> MQ: Publish LeaveHoldPlaced
MQ -> Manager: Notify
MQ -> HR: Notify

== Manager approves ==
Manager -> Gateway: POST /api/absences/{id}/manager-approve
Gateway -> Absence: ManagerApprove
Absence -> MQ: Publish LeaveManagerApproved

== HR approves ==
HR -> Gateway: POST /api/absences/{id}/hr-approve
Gateway -> Absence: HRApprove
Absence -> Absence: Finalize (hold -> deduct)
Absence -> MQ: Publish LeaveFinalized
MQ -> Attendance: Consume LeaveFinalized
Attendance -> Attendance: Mark days OnLeave
Attendance --> MQ: Ack

@enduml